# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-81eb03a035347035dfa4858536b5bc9979c073db "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]]. Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-d8beae3dc17378988770bd270dce7963b43efe0d "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
